{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Made popular by [[w:Jack Williamson|Jack Williamson]] in his 1941 book ''Dragon's Island''. First mentions of genetic engineering in print go back to 1910's.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|head=[[genetic]] [[engineering]]}}

# The practice or science of [[genetic modification]].
# [[genetic modification|Genetic modification]].

